is used to pass from the coordinate form of Mikhlin's hypothesis to the
invariant Fréchet-derivative form. -/
theorem norm_continuousMultilinearMap_le_of_basis_coordinates
    {d n : Nat}
    (T : Euclidean d [×n]→L[Real] Complex)
    {B : Real} (hB : 0 ≤ B)
